             Esperado conforme reforma (LC 214/LC 227):
               <AliquotaCBS>0.0010</AliquotaCBS>
               <ValorCBS>10.00</ValorCBS>
               <AliquotaIBS>0.0090</AliquotaIBS>
               <ValorIBS>90.00</ValorIBS>
        -->
        <ValorLiquido>9500.00</ValorLiquido>
